# Code Context Engine (CCE) - forced

Tree-sitter index + `context_search` MCP (`mcptoon_call context-engine context_search`). Git hooks keep it current.

- Prefer `context_search` over reading whole files.
- `cce savings` = tracked tokens/dollars; `cce status` = index health.
- Backend: bundled fastembed, local, no external service.
